        "\n",
        "This interactive shows how three ingredients affect a stylized training curve: learning rate, batch size, and KL regularization strength.  It is not a physical law of neural-network training; it is a visualization of the qualitative roles of step size, gradient noise, and distributional anchoring.\n",
